docs {
  # Health

  Open endpoint, no bearer token, not audited. Probes Postgres and Redis
  with a 2s budget each.

  **Expected**: `200 {"status":"ok",...}` when both dependencies are
  reachable, `503 {"status":"degraded",...}` otherwise (each dependency's
  own status is under `dependencies`).
}
